{"name": "Queen's Pact", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/fcaf3d3f1db2b512da156f484e837d5f.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/fcaf3d3f1db2b512da156f484e837d5f.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/fcaf3d3f1db2b512da156f484e837d5f.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Queen\u2019s Pact is a dark roguelite deckbuilder with auto-battler combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She judges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD SOMETHING SCANDALOUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/5e57bc840fc915bffd22b8bc8a1766b7.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/5e57bc840fc915bffd22b8bc8a1766b7.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/5e57bc840fc915bffd22b8bc8a1766b7.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go big or go home, the queen won't accept dreaming small.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/68eb04066af5f552f082df6d71e1b5f8.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/68eb04066af5f552f082df6d71e1b5f8.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/68eb04066af5f552f082df6d71e1b5f8.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit many exploration areas filled with procedural events, enemies and elites!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/ac4d59aaecd80340e2053e8ce47cc201.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REVIEW YOUR BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"674\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/f0115c0edf4ac62996e56a2896388557.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every fight ends with a report: damage card by card, triggers counted, the biggest hit named, and a clear view of which card carried and which one just stood there looking pretty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/135d3e0076963e58888b91459e621681.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRUSH HER COURT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/01a30746d6546594664fbd0f9e2d3e31.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/01a30746d6546594664fbd0f9e2d3e31.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/01a30746d6546594664fbd0f9e2d3e31.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses are mean and deadly. Will you outplay them and maybe impress the queen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/786f0ccc43ded17e343f3a7a4430de0d.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REPLAY YOUR TRIUMPH... OR DOWNFALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras_big/ed651963719a6caa2deb92c57b0a3fd5.avif?t=1795789085\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/ed651963719a6caa2deb92c57b0a3fd5.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Proud of that one? Replay any fight of the run. Slow it down, find the exact second it broke, and enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/5667a6db9e7cd78cf3643d4ea046da49.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISAPPOINT HER DIFFERENTLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/098ce0d4ce2585b6b153a884d9ff5c35.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/098ce0d4ce2585b6b153a884d9ff5c35.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/098ce0d4ce2585b6b153a884d9ff5c35.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A full run takes about an hour (30 minutes in the demo). See how far the build goes, then come back with a better one.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Champions with their own starting cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shrines, markets and fights. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four difficulties. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seeded runs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cards between runs. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK NEW POWER-UPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/a913e6d64577ab12870b333f721f00ba.poster.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/a913e6d64577ab12870b333f721f00ba.webm?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/a913e6d64577ab12870b333f721f00ba.mp4?t=1795789085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seal pacts for one run only, and unlock ink to sign permanent ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/28ce3a2dcb87bdd234960ba412a1627a.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REDECORATE HER COURT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is built out of simple files, and they are yours to ruin. She will pretend not to notice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replace any image by dropping a new file into a folder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edit lore text and balance values in plain configuration files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create new cards and relics the same way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/extras/b8fbc88dc979cbf8790859ce5e12e67e.avif?t=1795789085\" width=\"668\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out our demo!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Queen\u2019s Pact is a dark roguelite deckbuilder with auto-battler combat: sacrifice, chain and scale your cards into loops that should not be allowed. Break the game until the Queen is impressed.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5346060/1b42800ffdbab9d6577489b2e65b343e5be6f5b2/header.jpg?t=1795789085", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Card Game", "Roguelike", "Card Battler", "Roguelike Deckbuilder"], "developers": "Basalt Breach", "publishers": "Basalt Breach", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5346060", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/iTsa0SRsVYY", "first_seen": 1795734000.0, "review_rank": 1}